    <detaileddescription>
<para>Commonly used message types.</para><para>This namespace exists so that users can say <computeroutput>using namespace <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1_1Common" kindref="compound">Sawyer::Message::Common</ref></computeroutput> to be able to use the most important message types without name qualification and without also bringing in all the things that are less frequently used.</para><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The message importance levels: <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9af04facf962ba167db8a1e5d2b435fb93" kindref="member">DEBUG</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9a90bf0c35fdfdb66aa2a5760524878c92" kindref="member">TRACE</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9af3d19c270e9071c1ce2b5f2c3f6715dd" kindref="member">WHERE</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9a538a612c7a02e55d51e68b4dc4df21c3" kindref="member">MARCH</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9abaad1fa32e5fd30aad22a4dff4750e2b" kindref="member">INFO</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9a52f8e5eea9bfc070f3e0a152e3d1537a" kindref="member">WARN</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9a85ccc0760cef2470d0c119884610d394" kindref="member">ERROR</ref>, and <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1abfb4d3240797db3a74bbf691f708a1c9abb7c0d080435a4a981ba171d08dc3bb7" kindref="member">FATAL</ref>. </para></listitem>
<listitem><para>The types <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Message_1_1Stream" kindref="compound">Stream</ref>, <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Message_1_1Facility" kindref="compound">Facility</ref>, and <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Message_1_1Facilities" kindref="compound">Facilities</ref>.</para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
In particular, this does not include <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1_1Message_1acd499f89583295899897c1ba6336966a" kindref="member">Sawyer::Message::mlog</ref> since users often name their own facilities &quot;mlog&quot;. </para>    </detaileddescription>
